<pre class=metadata>
Title: Def Block Fragment Parsing
Group: test
Shortname: datablocks002
Level: 1
Status: LS
ED: http://example.com/datablocks002
Abstract: Testing direct fragment building in parseDefBlock() without serialize/reparse double-parsing.
Editor: Example Editor
Date: 1970-01-01
Markup Shorthands: markdown yes
Text Macro: ESCAPED &lt;b&gt;not bold&lt;/b&gt;
</pre>

<dfn at-rule>@test-rule</dfn>
<dfn>flow &amp; phrasing</dfn>
<dfn>metadata content</dfn>
<dfn>group &amp; more</dfn>
