</dl>
<dfn interface>MyElInterface</dfn>

<pre class=simpledef>
prefix <code>mid</code> suffix: lead <em>mid</em> tail
<code>only-key</code>: <em>only-val</em>
empty-val:
escapes: &lt;b&gt; &amp;lt;b&amp;gt; &bs<;i&bs>; `<span>`
macro-val: [ESCAPED]
<code>dup</code>: first
<code>dup:</code>: second
unclosed <b>key: unclosed <em>val
</pre>

